- id: xestion-ostrakinon-early-sense-1
  term_id: xestion-ostrakinon
  label: Used in a primitive downward-distillation/fumigation setup (Aetius 1.135).
  sense_order: 1
  perfume_relevance: core
  short_definition: Small earthenware vessel (sextarius).
  reader_summary: Used in a primitive downward-distillation/fumigation setup (Aetius 1.135). Aetius specifies using a handleless vessel (**ἄωτον**) and another with a long neck (**μακροτράχηλον**) buried in the earth to catch infused vapors without catching fire.
  citation_ids:
  - xestion-ostrakinon-early-cit-1
